# AI & ML Basics 🤖

## Simple Definition
AI = machines think like humans
ML = machines learn from data
DL = ML using neural networks

## Types of ML
Supervised   → learns from labels
Unsupervised → finds patterns
Reinforcement → learns from rewards

## Key Terms
Dataset  → collection of data
Model    → trained algorithm
Training → teaching the model
Accuracy → how correct model is

## Python AI Libraries
numpy      → numbers & arrays
pandas     → data analysis
matplotlib → charts & graphs
sklearn    → machine learning
